      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OAKLEY NZ (12) has had three runs this prep without filling a placing. Was again unable to find the frame last time when he finished eighth over 1609m at this track, beaten 50 metres. Hard to know where he gets from this slightly awkward draw. Meets a comparable field and he can make sharp improvement. MAJOR BUZZ (1) finished sixth last start over 2242m at Narrogin, beaten 7 metres, after finishing second at Gloucester Park the run prior. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a similar line up and he is capable of a much better performance. LIL MISS DELIGHT (2) is in the mix following a respectable third at her most recent appearance over 2100m at this track. BETTOR WASH UP (3) found form and scored two runs back then came back to earth when he broke and finished eighth last start over 2185m at Pinjarra, coming home 21 metres from the winner. No excuses from this advantageous draw. Won't find this any harder and he can bounce back.",
